 .
 Combined work: xrdp in this package links libx264 (GPL-2+) and FFmpeg's
 libavcodec/libavutil, which Debian and Ubuntu build with --enable-gpl
 (GPL-2+). The Apache-2.0 licensed xrdp code is compatible with GPL-3 but not
 with GPL-2 alone, so the binaries as distributed here are a combined work
 under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (on Debian systems:
 /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3). xrdp-genkeymap and xrdp-sesadmin are
 GPL-2+ themselves. The sources stay under the licenses listed below.
 .
 Corresponding source (patched xrdp and xorgxrdp source, packaging, build
 scripts, pristine upstream releases and patches) for every published version:
 https://linuxrrze.github.io/fast-rdp-server/sources/
 and attached to the GitHub releases of fast-rdp-server. Details:
 docs/licensing.md in the fast-rdp-server sources.

